to remove targeted content instantly.

35
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:24,550
These reports are often filed over minor personal details.

36
00:03:24,550 --> 00:03:29,350
In one instance, a creator successfully used a privacy strike against a rival

37
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:33,050
for using a photograph of a deceased mother as a profile picture,

38
00:03:33,050 --> 00:03:36,350
treating the digital image as a target for destruction.

39
00:03:36,530 --> 00:03:39,430
To ensure these reports are processed successfully,

40
00:03:39,430 --> 00:03:44,530
the Coven has begun employing external, non-human entities to draft their strikes.

41
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:48,030
